0..77 Comment "// A function\'s parameter at a session type is an endpoint its body drives to"
78..89 Comment "// its end."
90..92 Comment "//"
93..171 Comment "// A session action acts only on a linear binder, and a parameter binds in the"
172..245 Comment "// intuitionistic zone. The placement moves the parameter into one linear"
246..286 Comment "// binder of its name, which shadows it."
287..289 Comment "//"
290..360 Comment "// The lowering wraps the body in the placement. The checker opens the"
361..436 Comment "// parameter as an endpoint at its session type, and the readmission erases"
437..514 Comment "// the placement to its body. A call spends the caller\'s endpoint whole, as a"
515..590 Comment "// send delegates one, and the callee holds it from then on. On the machine"
591..668 Comment "// the placement holds the passed end in a fresh cell, as a receive holds its"
669..734 Comment "// payload. The callee\'s actions then reach the caller\'s channel."
735..737 Comment "//"
738..753 Comment "// - see: #1862"
754..769 Comment "// - see: #4501"
770..785 Comment "// - see: #4687"
